WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:51.844 --> 00:00:53.178
No hard feelings?

00:01:05.274 --> 00:01:06.358
Hands up.

00:01:23.500 --> 00:01:24.501
What the hell, man?

00:03:40.804 --> 00:03:42.347
You think my dad
cares about you?

00:03:42.431 --> 00:03:43.891
He's just trying to
make himself feel better

00:03:43.974 --> 00:03:44.933
for screwing up with me.

00:03:57.196 --> 00:03:58.071
Marks.

00:04:03.243 --> 00:04:04.077
Fight!

00:04:15.047 --> 00:04:16.089
Fighters ready?

00:04:17.508 --> 00:04:18.342
Fight!

00:04:27.017 --> 00:04:27.976
No point. Continue.

00:04:34.858 --> 00:04:35.943
No point.

00:04:36.985 --> 00:04:37.945
Continue fighting.

00:04:56.630 --> 00:04:58.131
Nice, Miguel, nice.

00:05:06.682 --> 00:05:07.516
No point.

00:05:07.599 --> 00:05:08.892
-Come on!
-Continue.

00:05:09.476 --> 00:05:10.727
Let's go!

00:05:12.354 --> 00:05:13.605
You can do this.

00:05:15.148 --> 00:05:16.233
I know you can.

00:05:16.316 --> 00:05:18.318
I'm always going to be
right here next to you.

00:05:18.402 --> 00:05:20.028
You're going to be
my karate teacher?

00:05:20.112 --> 00:05:22.447
No. I'm going to be
your sensei.

00:05:42.426 --> 00:05:44.344
Beat him up!

00:06:01.737 --> 00:06:02.905
No point.

00:06:04.823 --> 00:06:05.908
Continue.

00:06:21.548 --> 00:06:22.633
No point.

00:06:22.716 --> 00:06:23.592
It's OK.

00:06:31.850 --> 00:06:32.809
Come on.

00:06:33.685 --> 00:06:34.728
Come on!

00:06:54.831 --> 00:06:56.166
It's a block. No point.

